{"unit_id":"TingRuDeng__dsh-smart-approval#card-zh","repo":"TingRuDeng/dsh-smart-approval","commit":"a010a656dbba71182a04c26d87090173e9f35717","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-smart-approval 是面向 DeepSeek Harness Web 的审批审查插件，在 DSH 的审批请求流程中加入独立的自动审查处理，并提供手动、智能和无人值守三种模式。用户可以从会话输入框旁的选择器或会话命令切换模式，也可以查看本会话近期自动决策记录。智能审查调用 DSH 的 LLM 服务，默认使用当前会话路由，也可单独配置审查 provider 和 model；新会话默认使用 smart 模式。适合希望在 DSH 会话中选择审批处理方式、查看决策摘要的用户。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:89-100"]}
{"unit_id":"TingRuDeng__dsh-smart-approval#card-en","repo":"TingRuDeng/dsh-smart-approval","commit":"a010a656dbba71182a04c26d87090173e9f35717","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-smart-approval adds manual, smart, and unattended review modes to DSH Web approval requests. Switch modes from the composer or a session command, and view recent decision summaries. Smart review uses DSH LLM, with the current route or a separately configured provider and model.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:89-100"]}
